# `drive type` through the real key path, on the Make flow's typing screens (D184).
# Run on a fresh cabinet, before any maker exists. Ends back on the shelf with no maker kept.
wait shelf
press a
wait who
press a
wait say typing
# Capitals, a space, an apostrophe, a hyphen, digits: what a name can hold.
type Zoe O'Hara-2
expect Zoe O'Hara-2
shot typed-name
# Backspace mends a slip.
press backspace
press backspace
expect Zoe O'Hara
# Over the name limit stops at the limit: 16 in all.
type xyzXYZ789
shot typed-to-limit
press esc
sleep 500
press esc
sleep 500
press esc
wait shelf
